[deferred.accelerator-gate]
summary = "Coprocessor acceleration layer kept wired via a vendored AcceleratorGate stub"
detail = """
src/backends/abstract.jl, src/coprocessors/*.jl and ext/Cliometrics*Ext.jl are
written against AcceleratorGate.jl, the estate's intended shared
coprocessor-dispatch package. AcceleratorGate is not yet published/registered:
its original [deps] UUID (59f742c7-...) and the per-accelerator [weakdeps] UUIDs
(TPUCompute 1111..., NPUAccel 2222..., DSPLibs 3333..., FPGASynthesis 4444...,
VPURuntime 5555..., QPUInterface 6666..., PPUCompute 7777..., MathAccel 8888...,
CryptoAccel 9999...) were placeholders, so Pkg.instantiate() could never resolve
them and CI failed before running any tests.
"""
action = """
Vendored a minimal stub package at stub/AcceleratorGate (real UUID
864bd76c-64a8-41b8-be27-f0832a2936a3) providing the exact API the layer uses:
the backend type hierarchy, a permissive DeviceCapabilities record, and
device_capabilities / estimate_cost / register_operation! /
generate_self_healing_hooks. Cliometrics' [deps] points at it and
.github/workflows/ci.yml runs `Pkg.develop(path="stub/AcceleratorGate")` before
instantiate (registry-free; works on Julia 1.10 and 1.11). The fake-UUID
[weakdeps]/[extensions] tables were dropped; the coprocessor includes are
restored so the dispatch layer loads and precompiles. The GPU/accelerator
extension files remain in ext/ to be re-wired against real packages later.
"""
verification = """
Could not run Julia in the build sandbox (network policy blocks the JuliaLang
package server; apt has no julia). The stub is constructed so the only
load-time executions are register_operation!(::Type, ::Symbol) and a no-op
generate_self_healing_hooks; all device_capabilities/estimate_cost/
backend_coprocessor_* bodies are method definitions (compiled, not executed at
precompile). Static checks pass; full Pkg.test() pending a real CI run.
"""
re-wire = "Replace stub/AcceleratorGate with the real AcceleratorGate.jl once published (drop the Pkg.develop step + repoint [deps] to the registered UUID), then restore real [weakdeps]/[extensions] for the GPU backends."
tracking-issue = "hyperpolymath/Cliometrics.jl#17"
blocked-on = "Publication/registration of AcceleratorGate.jl (shared estate dependency; same placeholder pattern handled in ZeroProb.jl#17 and Causals.jl#19)"
